  "_comment": "Pathological input for tests/test-harness.sh: each unit is repeated to about 64 kB and fed to every Gemini CLI rule; kimi_parts holds one sample of each part of the Kimi hook's multi-part rules, each in a segment of its own, so every such rule becomes a candidate without any firing. Kept out of the suite: pr-guard reads the suite and refuses the merge commands.",
